**/*.pt
**/*.bin
**/*.safetensors
**/*.onnx
**/*.ckpt

# Dataset archives
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.7z

# Media samples
**/*.m4a
**/*.mp3
**/*.wav
**/*.mp4

